    "description": "Discover this exceptional investment property featuring 5 units in the desirable Sunset District, just south of Golden Gate Park. This well-maintained building retains its original condition and provides a unique opportunity for both investors and owner-users. An ideal candidate for a 1031 exchange. Property Highlight include a total of 5 units; 4 identical 1-bedroom/1-bath units . 2 of which are vacant and offer immediate rental potential. Each 1-Bedroom Unit has a well maintained original interior and includes a spacious eat-in kitchen, a formal living room and a full bath.  In addition, there is a garden -level studio apartment .Parking: A large garage with 2 separate s/s garage doors allows for 3 cars. The property also features a generous backyard. Close proximity to UCSF, Golden Gate Park, and vibrant shopping areas on Irving and Judah streets.  A highly sought-after neighborhood that appeals to a range of tenants.  This property not only stands out for its solid investment potential but also provides a wonderful opportunity for those looking to occupy a unit in a prime area of San Francisco. Don't miss this chance to own a piece of the Sunset District!"
  },
